' implemented:  partial
' ai-assisted:  yes / Claude Opus 5 / 依 19 個 schema 重繪，補上 usage_logs、clips、
'               line_bind_tokens、video_segments_video 與 shortassets 參照
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title MongoDB核心集合關聯圖

package "帳號與課程" {
  rectangle "users" as Users
  rectangle "avatars" as Avatars
  rectangle "line_bind_tokens" as BindTokens
  rectangle "courses" as Courses
  rectangle "enrollments" as Enrollments
}

package "影片與知識片段" {
  rectangle "videobatches" as Batches
  rectangle "videos" as Videos
  rectangle "video_segments_text" as Leaf
  rectangle "video_segments_parent" as Parent
  rectangle "video_segments_video" as Visual
  rectangle "clips" as Clips
}

package "問答與對話" {
  rectangle "conversations" as Conversations
  rectangle "messages" as Messages
  rectangle "questions" as Questions
  rectangle "faqs" as Faqs
}

package "營運與內容產出" {
  rectangle "usage_logs" as UsageLogs
  rectangle "notifications" as Notifications
  rectangle "shortscripts" as Scripts
  rectangle "shortassets" as Assets
}

Users --> Avatars : userId\n1 : 0..1
Users --> BindTokens : userId\n1 : 0..*
Users --> Courses : teacherId\n1 : 0..*
Users --> Enrollments : studentId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Enrollments : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Videos : courseId / videoIds[]\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Batches : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Batches --> Videos : items[].videoId\n1 : 0..*
Videos --> Leaf : String(_id) = videoId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Parent : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Parent --> Leaf : childChunkIds[] = chunkId\n1 : 1..*
Videos --> Visual : pipeline video_id\n1 : 0..*
Leaf --> Clips : segmentId\n1 : 0..1

Users --> Conversations : userId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Conversations : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Conversations --> Messages : conversationId\n1 : 0..*
Users --> Questions : userId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Questions : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Faqs : courseId\n1 : 0..*

Users --> UsageLogs : userId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> UsageLogs : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Questions --> UsageLogs : sourceUsageLogId\n0..1 : 1
Users --> Notifications : recipientId\n1 : 0..*
Notifications ..> Videos : videoId
Notifications ..> Scripts : scriptId
Courses --> Scripts : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Courses --> Assets : courseId\n1 : 0..*
Scripts --> Assets : sourceScriptId\n1 : 0..*
Videos ..> Assets : sourceVideoId

note as Constraint
  非 UML 圖：文件型資料庫集合關聯圖。
  箭頭代表文件中以 ObjectId 或字串識別欄位保存的參照方向，不是資料庫外鍵。
  MongoDB 不強制參照完整性，參照的建立、解除與刪除連動由 service 層維護。
  虛線為選填的深層連結參照。
end note

@enduml
